# fib: : fib ( n -- f ) dup 2 < if exit then dup 1 - recurse swap 2 - recurse + ; 10 fib emit 12 fib 100 - emit (return codes and values on arrays)
:dst array 5 8
:rst array 5 8
:dsp data 8 0
